{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"interactivity budget interactivity budget","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md","fileName":"Interactivity Budget.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Interactivity Budget","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Interactivity]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Interactivity","Engagement","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"interactivity budget interactivity budget","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md","fileName":"Interactivity Budget.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Interactivity Budget","heading":"Interactivity Budget","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An interactivity budget is the finite amount of perceptual, cognitive, social, and emotional effort a player is willing and able to devote at a moment. Fast reflexive interactions often consume capacity before slower reflective ones can operate.\n\nDesigners allocate this budget by deciding which loops are intense at the same time and by separating competing demands across time. Exceeding it creates confusion or exhaustion; using too little can produce boredom and weak [[Engagement]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Interactivity","Engagement","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"interactivity budget interactivity budget","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Interactivity Budget.md","fileName":"Interactivity Budget.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Interactivity Budget","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Interactivity","Engagement","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}